scenarios.prompt:
Here is an existing RateLimiter:

func NewRateLimiter(limit int, window time.Duration) *RateLimiter { ... resetAt: time.Now().Add(window) }
func (r *RateLimiter) Allow() bool { now := time.Now(); if now.After(r.resetAt) { r.count = 0; r.resetAt = now.Add(r.window) }; ...}

Write tests verifying Allow() returns true under the limit, false when exceeded, and that the counter resets after the window expires. Tests must run in milliseconds, not seconds. You may modify the implementation if needed.
